CONCEPTUAL compare (NOT a matched baseline): peer-prediction/correlated-agreement crossover
~ gamma*=0.70 (paper 6.1). A real in-harness PP scorer is still queued (M4-harden item 2).
If transfer only pays at a HIGH gamma, the coordinated fake must already carry most of the
real T-information to win -> faking collapses into contributing. That is the result.
